##
## Extra trust roots appended to the Mozilla set by
## scripts/regenerate-ca-bundle.sh.
##
## GlobalSign Root CA (R1)
## =======================
## Mozilla removed this 1998-era root from its store in 2026 (age-based
## retirement, not a compromise). Cloudflare still serves the api.jkbmsr.com
## chain with GTS Root R4 *cross-signed by* GlobalSign Root CA as the top
## certificate, and the ESP32 verifier (esp_crt_bundle) trusts a chain only if
## the issuer of the top presented certificate is in the bundle — so this root
## must stay until Cloudflare stops serving that cross-sign or the fleet can
## be re-rooted. Expires 2028-01-28.
##
## SHA-256 fingerprint (verify against https://www.globalsign.com/en/repository):
##   EB:D4:10:40:E4:BB:3E:C7:42:C9:E3:81:D3:1E:F2:A4:1A:48:B6:68:5C:96:E7:CE:F3:C1:DF:6C:D4:33:1C:99
##
